anzhang-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-40b37903b6de145c9576","layer":"original","quote":"追谥超曰威侯，子承嗣。岱位至平北将军，进爵陈仓侯。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o034","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-7ddd1fa08ce5c9feb1d4","layer":"original","quote":"二年卒〖13〗，时年四十七。临没上疏曰：“臣门宗二百余口〖14〗，为孟德所诛略尽〖15〗；惟有从弟岱，当为微宗血食之继〖16〗，深托陛下。余无复言。”","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o035","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-40b37903b6de145c9576","layer":"original","quote":"追谥超曰威侯，子承嗣。岱位至平北将军，进爵陈仓侯。超女，配安平王理〖17〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-1b34bb87b09da04cd707","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-6dc52065d442a8329e1d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏略》曰：“诸葛亮病，谓延等云：‘我之死后，但谨自守，慎勿复来也！’令延摄行己事，密持丧去。延遂匿之，行至褒口，乃发丧。亮长史杨仪，宿与延不和，见延摄行军事，惧为所害；乃张言延欲举众北附，遂率其众攻延。延本无此心，不战军走，追而杀之。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略（异说）","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":323,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a579fc2d130429316a3e","start":0,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-fd55cb6c6430cf57b659","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-96862d35761cedcbeb53","layer":"original","quote":"延独与其子数人逃亡，奔汉中。仪遣马岱追斩之〖16〗，致首于仪；仪起自踏之，曰：“庸奴〖17〗，复能作恶不？”遂夷延三族","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
